* landing pages
* FAQs
* blog/resources

## 2. Semantic search

Add embeddings for:

* course descriptions
* workshop outlines
* internship briefs
* mentor bios
* FAQ answers
* legal/support docs

This helps users search things like:

* “AI internship with certificate”
* “nanotech course for university students”
* “biotech workshop with live mentor”

## 3. Personalized recommendations

Use signals like:

* visited domains
* viewed product types
* completed programs
* learner segment
* price range
* search history

Show:

* related products
* next-best program
* recommended mentors
* recommended domain tracks

Do not make this too advanced in v1.
For v1, keyword + filtered search + related products is enough.

