# Critical system flows

## Flow 1: Purchase and access

1. User lands on product page
2. Clicks enroll
3. Razorpay order created
4. Payment completes
5. Razorpay webhook hits backend
6. Backend verifies signature
7. Enrollment record created/updated
8. Moodle enrollment triggered
9. Invoice generated
10. Confirmation email/WhatsApp sent
11. Dashboard access unlocked

Use webhook as authority, not browser return URL. ([Razorpay][4])

## Flow 2: Refund/cancellation

1. User requests cancellation/refund
2. Policy engine checks eligibility
3. Admin/program manager reviews if needed
4. Razorpay refund initiated if approved
5. Access rules updated
6. Invoice/refund notes stored
7. User notified

## Flow 3: Certificate issuance

1. Completion criteria met in Moodle
2. Completion sync to platform
3. Certificate eligibility confirmed
4. Certificate file/link issued
5. Dashboard + email updated

