# What I would avoid

## 1. Avoid building everything inside Moodle

It will slow marketing, SEO, design flexibility, and experimentation.

## 2. Avoid multiple disconnected CMSs

One source of truth for content/catalog.

## 3. Avoid separate product models for every domain

Keep one `Product` model with taxonomy relations.

## 4. Avoid using page builders for deep logic

Fine for simple pages, bad for your complex catalog/enrollment logic.

## 5. Avoid rebuilding LMS before validating website and commerce layer

That is the highest-risk move.

